        "username": "Trusty_Mutsi",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/dbc845/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-17T23:48:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"XChylde\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xchylde/48/2559_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> XChylde:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That still leaves no deck control and devastating aurora to contend with.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have to think the three heroes got lucky and Citizen Dawn was unlucky, because I'm playing again and the heroes are not doing nearly as well.</p>",
