        "created_at": "2013-02-18T00:51:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are only two Devastating Auroras in the deck, and unlike the Chairman she doesn't start with 10 cards in the trash and the ability to fetch another 5 out of the deck. It's not too unlikely that you just won't see the Devastating Auroras.</p>",
