        "created_at": "2013-02-18T01:02:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the only game against her I can really say was easy was Tachyon, Wraith, AZ, and Fanatic (random roll). With Wraith using the infrared eyepiece to control her deck and AZ tanking, the last turn came down to Dawn with 3 hp, my crew pretty much all in the mid to low teens, and the possibility of unloading 53 points of damage between all my heroes that round!</p>",
